{"id":"284f91065f20db13","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-recursive-enumerable.md","title":"Recursively Enumerable Set","display":"df-recursive-enumerable — Recursively Enumerable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-recursive-enumerable","aliases":["88-df-recursive-enumerable","RE","r.e."],"display":"df-recursive-enumerable — Recursively Enumerable Set","depends_on":["[[88-df-ce-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-recursive-enumerable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-recursive-enumerable</span><span>RE</span><span>r.e.</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursive-enumerable — Recursively Enumerable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (candidate set of natural numbers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}(S)\\)</span> (recursively enumerable predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(S)\\)</span> (computably enumerable predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}enumerable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RE}(S)\n\\leftrightarrow S\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{CE}(S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}enumerable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RE}(S)\n\\leftrightarrow S\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{CE}(S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“recursively enumerable”与“computably enumerable”是同一集合类的历史术语；\n本文件只登记别名，不重复占用<code>CE</code>或<code>c.e.</code>的元数据别名。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}(S)$ (computably enumerable predicate, see [[88-df-ce-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}enumerable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RE}(S)\n\\leftrightarrow S\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{CE}(S)","display":true}],"bytes":845,"backlinks":[{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-delta.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-sigma.md]]\n[[88-df-assignment.md]]\n[[88-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-axiom.md]]\n[[88-df-bijective.md]]\n[[88-df-bound-variable.md]]\n[[88-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[88-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[88-df-cardinality.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[88-